flowchart TD
    %% Styling
    classDef lookup fill:#e1f5fe,stroke:#01579b,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef execute fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef store fill:#f3e5f5,stroke:#4a148c,stroke-width:1px;

    UopEntry([Micro-Op Evaluation]) --> ActionSwitch{uop.action}

    %% Copy
    ActionSwitch -->|copy| Copy_Action[copy]:::execute
    Copy_Action --> Copy_1[Resolve source operand]:::lookup
    Copy_1 --> Copy_Write[Write value to dest operand]:::store

    %% ALU
    ActionSwitch -->|alu| ALU_Action[alu]:::execute
    ALU_Action --> ALU_1[Resolve inputs: a, b, c]:::lookup
    ALU_1 --> ALU_2[Execute expression through Shunting-Yard Evaluator]:::execute
    ALU_2 --> ALU_3[Apply data_width mask & determine flags]:::execute
    ALU_3 --> ALU_Write[Write result value to destination operand]:::store
    ALU_3 -->|update_flags == true| ALU_Flags[Write flags to $FLAGS register]:::store

    %% Branch
    ActionSwitch -->|branch| Branch_Action[branch]:::execute
    Branch_Action --> Br_1{Check Branch Condition}:::lookup
    Br_1 -->|Any configured flag name/type, e.g. Z, C, O, N, or !inverts| Br_2{Condition Met?}:::execute
    Br_2 -->|Yes| Br_Write[Set PC target & set pc_modified_ = true]:::store
    Br_2 -->|No| Br_Nop[Proceed without modifying PC]:::execute

    %% Mem Read/Write
    ActionSwitch -->|mem_read| MRead[mem_read]:::execute
    MRead --> MR_1[Resolve address operand]:::lookup
    MR_1 --> MR_2[Check segment protection R/X]:::execute
    MR_2 -->|Success| MR_Write[Load value into destination register]:::store

    ActionSwitch -->|mem_write| MWrite[mem_write]:::execute
    MWrite --> MW_1[Resolve address and data operands]:::lookup
    MW_1 --> MW_2[Check segment protection W]:::execute
    MW_2 -->|Success| MW_Write[Write data to target memory address]:::store

    %% Peripheral Mappings
    MW_Write -->|MMIO Range Match| MMIO_Hook[Trigger Declarative Peripheral MMIO on_write AST]:::execute
    MR_2 -->|MMIO Range Match| MMIO_Hook_R[Trigger Declarative Peripheral MMIO on_read AST]:::execute

    %% Port I/O (separate address space from MMIO, bypasses segment checks)
    ActionSwitch -->|port_read| PRead[port_read]:::execute
    PRead --> PR_1[Resolve port operand]:::lookup
    PR_1 --> PR_Write[Memory::port_read -> write value to dest]:::store

    ActionSwitch -->|port_write| PWrite[port_write]:::execute
    PWrite --> PW_1[Resolve port and data operands]:::lookup
    PW_1 --> PW_Write[Memory::port_write]:::store

    %% Coprocessor register access
    ActionSwitch -->|coproc_read| CRead[coproc_read]:::execute
    CRead --> CR_1[Resolve cp id and reg id]:::lookup
    CR_1 --> CR_Write[RegisterFile::read_coproc -> write to dest]:::store

    ActionSwitch -->|coproc_write| CWrite[coproc_write]:::execute
    CWrite --> CW_1[Resolve cp id, reg id and data]:::lookup
    CW_1 --> CW_Write[RegisterFile::write_coproc]:::store

    %% Halt
    ActionSwitch -->|halt| Halt_Action[halt]:::execute
    Halt_Action --> Halt_Set[Set halted_ = true, CPU stops stepping]:::store
